The '''Biomnitrix'''{{Refn|group = note|The name Biomnitrix was coined by [[Derrick J. Wyatt|Derrick]],{{Refn|[[:File:Biomnitrix Name Reveal.png]]|group = DJW|name = Dev}}{{Refn|[[:File:Biomnitrix is real.png]]|group = DJW}} however, the device was left unnamed in the scripts, with [[Matt Wayne|Matt]] and [[Charlotte McDuffie|Charlotte]] being unaware of the term.{{Refn|[[:File:Nemetrix Tech Level.png]]|group = MW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Biomnitrix Name Not Canon According to Matt Wayne.png]]|group = MW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Not Biomnitrix in scripts.png]]|group = CM}}}} is the dual-[[Omnitrix]] system that [[Ben 10,000 (Original)|Ben 10,000]] develops in the [[Original Future Timeline|future]],{{Refn|group = DJW|name = Dev}} that has the ability to combine DNA samples.

==Appearance ==
The Biomnitrix takes the forms of two dark green gauntlets with black and green rectangles borrowing the same hourglass symbol as the Omnitrix.

==History==
===Background===
Years after rediscovering his childhood happiness of being a hero when [[Ben 10,000 (Episode)|he met]] his [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|10-year-old self]],{{Refn|[[:File:DJW came up with Biomnitrix.png]]|name = idea|group = DJW}} [[Ben 10,000 (Original)|Ben 10,000]] developed the Biomnitrix,{{Refn|group = DJW|name = Dev}} with the help of his smartest aliens.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben 10,000 Smartest aliens.PNG]]|group = DJW}}

==Features==
===General===
<gallery type="slideshow" widths="300">
ATTWN (276).png|Active Mode/Voice Command
TEoaE (391).png|User Transformation
TWB (403.5).png|Time Out
TEoaE (521.5).png|Detransformation due to user's damage/stamina
</gallery>
*The Biomnitrix is two Omnitricies that are linked together, thus allowing the user to perform alien [[Combinations (Classic)|combinations]] by slamming the two gauntlets together. 
**The combinations are not stored in the Biomnitrix, rather, they are created when being transformed into.{{Refn|[[:File:Biomnitrix Fusion Process.png]]|group = DJW}}
**By using just one gauntlet, the user can transform into normal aliens.{{Refn|[[:File:Biomnitrix Can Give Normal Aliens.png]]|group = DJW}} 
***Each gauntlet has full access to all unlocked aliens.{{Refn|[[:File:Both Biomnitrix Gauntlets Have All Aliens.png]]|group = DJW}}
*The Biomnitrix can transform the user without having to say the alien's name.<ref>''[[And Then There Was Ben]]''</ref><ref>''[[Let's Do the Time War Again]]''</ref><ref name="TEoaE" />
*If the user in a transformation falls unconscious or gets hurt enough, they will detransform.<ref name="TEoaE">''[[The End of an Era]]''</ref>

===Extensions===
*The Bionitrix can add extras to lifeforms to make them safer and more usable, such as [[Humungoopsaur]]'s [[Anti-Gravity Projector (Classic)|Anti-Gravity Projector]].

=== Clothing===
*The Biomnitrix usually provided clothes to the aliens that are based on what the user is wearing.

===Allocation===
*The Biomnitrix symbol is positioned on different places for each alien whenever the user is transformed.

===Voice Command===
*The Biomnitrix can be voice-controlled.{{Refn|name = VC|group = DJW}}
**'''Transformation Name''': Transforms the user by saying the name of the transformation.{{Refn|[[:File:Biomnitrix Voice Control Confirmed.png]]|name = VC|group = DJW}}

===Malfunctions===
<gallery type="slideshow" widths="300">
TEoaE (347).png|Electromagnetic Pulse Vulnerability
TEoaE (570).png|Frozen in Time (via Temporal Interference)
</gallery>
*The Biomnitrix can be temporarily disabled if it is exposed to a large electromagnetic pulse, such as from a solar flare.<ref name="TEoaE" />
*The Biomnitrix may stop working when frozen in time by a [[Chronosapien]].<ref name="TEoaE" />

==Alien Combinations==
In principle, the Biomnitrix can fuse any alien with any other.{{Refn|group = DJW|[[:File:Biomnitrix can fuse any alien together.png]]}} Thus, all possible [[Combinations (Classic)|combinations]] are accessible via the Biomnitrix.
