==Trivia==
*The Biomnitrix represents the idea that Ben 10,000 has learned a lesson to lighten up.{{Refn|name = idea|group = DJW}}
*Though [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]] thinks the Biomnitrix is silly, he is ultimately just relieved that Ben is having fun again.{{Refn|[[:File:Azmuth's Opinion of the Biomnitrix.png]]|group = DJW}}
*[[Derrick J. Wyatt]] came up with the Biomnitrix,{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick Came Up with the Biomnitrix.png]]|group = DJW}} as he wanted a way to have [[Thomas N. Perkins IV]] do more combinations on the show.{{Refn|name = idea|group = DJW}}
**The decision was made because Cartoon Network and Bandai thought the show had too many aliens and wanted more focus on existing aliens instead of adding more.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Alien Limit.png]]|group = DJW}} Therefore, the Biomnitrix serves as a loophole,{{Refn|[[:File:Biomnitrix Loophole.png]]|group = DJW}} giving Ben 10,000 unique transformations without adding new aliens.
*Out of all the concept ideas, [[Gravadactyl]] and [[XLRG]] were the only ones that were drawn. The others were "names on the board".{{Refn|group = DJW|name = link}}
*All Biomnitrix combinations were drawn by [[Thomas N. Perkins IV]].{{Refn|[[:File:Biomnitrix Fusions Made By Perkins Proof.png]]|group = DJW}}
**Tom Perkins drew more combinations for the online game [[DNA Lab]]. While not canon to the show, they can be viewed [[DNA Lab/Gallery|here]].
*When the Biomnitrix times out, the sounds of the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|latest]] Omnitrix'  time-out clips plays twice simultaneously.
**When activated, the Biomnitrix has the sound of the [[Omnitrix (Original)|prototype Omnitrix]].<ref name="TEoaE"/>
*All combinations involving [[Way Big (Classic)|Way Big]] are smaller than Way Big unless he is fused with something of the same size or bigger.{{Refn|[[:File:Way Big Fusions Smaller than Way Big.png]]|group = DJW}}
**Nano-Big is the height of an average human.{{Refn|group = DJW|name = link 3}}
**A combination between Way Big and [[Plantapocalypse]] would be as big as [https://godzilla.fandom.com/wiki/Biollante_(Heisei) Biollante] or [[Wikipedia:Godzilla|Godzilla]].{{Refn|[[:File:Way Big-Plantapocalypse Fusion Concept.png]]|group = TNP}}
*Alien W has cosmically amplified pain receptors.{{Refn|[[:File:Alien X-The Worst Fusion Concept.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Stinkfire smells like burning garbage.{{Refn|[[:File:What Stinkfire Smells Like.png]]|group = DJW}}
*A combination between [[Echo Echo]] and [[Brainstorm]] would shoot psychic sound waves.{{Refn|group = DJW|[[:File:Echostorm Psychic Sound Waves.png]]}}
*A combination between [[Toepick]] and [[Chromastone]] would shoot a prismatic laser beam from his single eye when people are the most terrified.{{Refn|[[:File:Toepick-Chromastone Fusion Concept.png]]|group = DJW}}
*A combination between [[Heatblast (Classic)|Heatblast]] and [[Waterhazard]] would produce steam.{{Refn|[[:File:Heatblast-Water Hazard Fusion Concept.png]]|group = DJW}}
*A combination between [[Grey Matter (Classic)|Grey Matter]] and [[Brainstorm]] would have as much enhanced intelligence as Grey Matter.{{Refn|[[:File:Grey Matter-Brainstorm Fusion Concept.png]]|group = DJW}}

